ext":"using "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" objects. You can also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"#Extracting-GeoJSON-data-from-the-map"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Converting-GeoJSON-data-into-shape-objects","text":"Converting GeoJSON data into shape objects"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you have GeoJSON data in the form of source code (also known as “GeoJSON"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"text”), you can convert it into an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature"},{"type":"text","text":", or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollectionFeature"},{"type":"text","text":" object that the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},{"type":"text","text":" class understands"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"natively. First, create an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSData"},{"type":"text","text":" object out of the source code string or file"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"contents, then pass that data object into the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape\/shapeWithData:encoding:error:"},{"type":"text","text":" method. Finally, you can pass the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resulting shape or feature object into the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:shape:options:"},{"type":"text","text":" initializer and add it to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the map, or you can use the object and its properties to power non-map-related"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"functionality in your application."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To include multiple shapes in the source, create and pass an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollection"},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollectionFeature"},{"type":"text","text":" object to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:shape:options:"},{"type":"text","text":". Alternatively, use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:features:options:"},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:shapes:options:"},{"type":"text","text":" method to create a shape source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with an array. "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:features:options:"},{"type":"text","text":" accepts only "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"t